---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="AuthBrain | Services" description="Python-first AI services for agents, automation, and internal tools.">
  <Header />
  <main class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 lg:py-24">
    <section class="max-w-3xl space-y-5">
      <span class="inline-flex rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-white/5 px-4 py-2 text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-[0.28em] text-white/[0.72]">
        Services
      </span>
      <h1 class="text-5xl font-semibold leading-none tracking-[-0.05em] text-white sm:text-6xl">
        Clear Python services for practical AI delivery.
      </h1>
      <p class="text-base leading-7 text-white/[0.72] sm:text-lg">
        The offer is intentionally small. Each service can stand alone, but they also connect into one agentic delivery path.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mt-12 grid gap-5 lg:grid-cols-3">
      <article class="clinical-frame rounded-[1.75rem] p-6">
        <p class="metric-label">Service 01</p>
        <h2 class="mt-4 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.04em] text-white">Python automation</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-white/[0.68]">Scripts, internal tools, and task pipelines that remove repetitive work and keep the stack easy to maintain.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="clinical-frame rounded-[1.75rem] p-6">
        <p class="metric-label">Service 02</p>
        <h2 class="mt-4 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.04em] text-white">AI agent systems</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-white/[0.68]">Plan, act, verify flows for assistants that can handle multi-step work without hiding the logic.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="clinical-frame rounded-[1.75rem] p-6">
        <p class="metric-label">Service 03</p>
        <h2 class="mt-4 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.04em] text-white">Simple product pages</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-white/[0.68]">Focused landing pages and dashboards for Python-backed services, tools, and agent demos.</p>
      </article>
    </section>

    <section class="mt-12 grid gap-5 lg:grid-cols-[0.9fr_1.1fr]">
      <div class="clinical-frame rounded-[1.75rem] p-6">
        <p class="metric-label">Working style</p>
        <h2 class="mt-4 text-3xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.04em] text-white">Small scope. Fast delivery. Easy handoff.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="clinical-frame rounded-[1.75rem] p-6">
        <ul class="space-y-4 text-sm leading-7 text-white/[0.72]">
          <li>Python logic stays readable and reusable.</li>
          <li>Pages stay simple and route-based.</li>
          <li>AI details are visible instead of buried.</li>
          <li>Each page has one job and one message.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>